  Let $\mu, \nu$ be two finite measures on $\mathcal X$ and let $\kappa : \mathcal X \rightsquigarrow \mathcal Y$ be a Markov kernel.
  Then $R_\alpha(\kappa \circ \mu, \kappa \circ \nu) \le R_\alpha(\mu, \nu)$.
\end{theorem}

n18163.content:
