The function $x \mapsto \frac{1}{\alpha - 1}\log (1 + (\alpha - 1)x)$ is non-decreasing and $D_f$ satisfies the DPI (Theorem~\ref{thm:fDiv_data_proc_2}), hence we get the DPI for $R_\alpha$.
\end{proof}

