  {m𝒳 : MeasurableSpace 𝒳} {m𝒳' : MeasurableSpace 𝒳'} {m𝒴 : MeasurableSpace 𝒴} {m𝒵 : MeasurableSpace 𝒵}
  (E : ProbabilityTheory.estimationProblem Θ 𝒴 𝒵) (P : ProbabilityTheory.Kernel Θ 𝒳) (π : MeasureTheory.Measure Θ)
  (η : ProbabilityTheory.Kernel 𝒳 𝒳') [inst : ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel η],
  LE.le (ProbabilityTheory.bayesRiskPrior E P π) (ProbabilityTheory.bayesRiskPrior E (η.comp P) π)

